# Issue tracking — GitHub Issues

Required env: `GITHUB_TOKEN` (or fine-grained PAT scoped to issues + pull-requests).

## Operations

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=github-issues -->

- Create issue → `mcp__github__createIssue`
- Update state → `mcp__github__updateIssue`
- Comment → `mcp__github__createIssueComment`
- Link to PR → `mcp__github__createPullRequest` and reference the issue body

